      "message": "hash: Move SHA256 self-test into hash module\n\nsecp256k1_selftest_sha256 only exercises the hash module and is also\nused to validate a caller-supplied compression function in\nsecp256k1_context_set_sha256_compression. Move it next to\nsecp256k1_sha256_smoke_test and rename it to secp256k1_sha256_selftest\nto match the naming of the module it lives in.\n\nNo functional change.",
